# Admin App (`apps/admin`)

## Purpose

Internal tool for waitlist approval, user lookup, and platform stats. Port **3004**.

## Auth (separate from dashboard)

- Email/password via Better Auth at **`/api/admin-auth`** (not `/api/auth`)
- Session cookie prefix: `harmonia-admin` (dashboard uses `harmonia-dashboard`)
- Signing into admin **does not** sign you into the dashboard
- Layout gate: `role === "admin"` in `(admin)/layout.tsx`
- API gate: `adminProcedure` resolves `context.adminSession` only

```typescript
// apps/admin/src/shared/api/auth-client.ts
createAuthClient({
  baseURL: env.NEXT_PUBLIC_HARMONIA_API_URL,
  basePath: "/api/admin-auth",
  plugins: [adminClient()],
});
```

## Directory Structure

```
apps/admin/src/
  app/(admin)/          # gated routes (overview, waitlist, users)
  app/login/
  components/app/       # admin-* feature components
  components/layout/    # sidebar, providers
  shared/api/           # orpc, auth-client, session.server
  lib/env.ts            # env re-export only
```

## Pages

| Route | Purpose |
|-------|---------|
| `/login` | Email/password sign-in; non-admins are rejected after auth |
| `/` | Stats overview (users, tracks, waitlist, pipeline) |
| `/waitlist` | Paginated waitlist; approve/reject/resend invite; notes |
| `/users` | Read-only user list with role, approval, banned badges |

## Data Fetching

- TanStack Query v5 via `orpc.admin.*` from `@/shared/api/orpc`
- Invalidate with `orpc.admin.waitlist.key()` / `orpc.admin.stats.key()`

## Local Setup

```bash
pnpm db:seed    # requires HARMONIA_ADMIN_PASSWORD in .env
pnpm dev:admin  # needs API on :3002
```

Default seed email: `admin@harmonia.com` (override with `HARMONIA_ADMIN_EMAIL`).
